AB  - This deposit contains a 5,000-row sample from the worldwide food catalog indexed by DietlyAPI. The dataset includes stable food identifiers, food names, brands, EAN/UPC barcodes, categories, serving information, calories, macronutrients, selected micronutrients, source labels, and confidence values. The sample is intended for data exploration, prototyping, teaching, reproducible examples, and evaluating whether the DietlyAPI data structure fits an application. Some values are missing because the underlying community-contributed product records vary in completeness. Nutrition values describe the serving recorded in each row and are not necessarily normalized per 100 g. Barcode misses and nullable nutrition fields should be expected. DietlyAPI provides fuzzy, confidence-aware search across more than 4.2 million indexed foods, barcode lookup, and stable food-ID retrieval. DietlyAPI product page Postman documentation Hugging Face dataset Kaggle dataset This sample contains data derived primarily from Open Food Facts. When publicly using or redistributing applicable data, retain the required Open Food Facts attribution and Open Database License notice.
