AB  - The continuous rise in dietary choices play critical role in person's health addressing the need for intelligent app designed to help users make better dietary decisions. Our application, NutriScan provides a solid solution which integrates basic information from the Open Food Facts API and unique NutriScan database with facts from verified sources for selected products to ensure accuracy and reliability. The application allows users to scan the QR codes of packaged food products to fetch list of ingredients and health-related information. A dynamic web link is generated with each QR scan thus redirecting to our customized web page which represents visuals and insights of nutritional information of the scanned product. The application also includes alternative food remedies, daily food recommendations, calorie tracking to support the overall nutrient requirements. The hybrid approach of our system includes our own database, NutriScan Random Forest Model and QR code Scanner. The NutriScan RF Model achieves 80 percent accuracy and provides valuable insights into the suitability of products for diabetics as well. Overall, by combining the verified database system, intelligent data extraction and valuable nutrient insights provide real-time approach to dietary consciousness and human living.
