TY  - JOUR
TI  - Recipe Calculation Tool For Food Data Compilation
AU  - Rogel Villapaz
AU  - Samson
AU  - Elyss Billedo
AU  - Ivy Refugio
PY  - 2026
JO  - Zenodo (CERN European Organization for Nuclear Research)
DO  - 10.5281/zenodo.20826363
UR  - https://openalex.org/W7165789088
AB  - The Recipe Calculation Tool was developed by the Department of Science and Technology - Food and Nutrition Research Institute (DOST-FNRI), Food Quality and Safety Section. This tool is developed to provide accurate, automated nutrient composition calculations for recipes, adhering to the FAO/INFOODS mixed method guidelines for recipe-level calculation. This semi-automated tool streamlines the complex process of translating raw ingredient data into comprehensive nutritional profiles of prepared foods for public health research, food formulation, dietary assessments, etc. This Recipe Calculation Tool User's Manual contains step-by-step instructions on how to use the tool. This manual also contains links for International (Customizable) and Philippine (Pre-configured) versions of the recipe calculation tool, which are ready for copy/download.
